Package: thinkfan-gnome-extension
Version: 1.0
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 48), pkexec | policykit-1
Maintainer: growlnx <growlnx@protonmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/growlnx/thinkfan-gnome-extension
Description: Quick Settings fan level selector for ThinkPads
 GNOME Shell extension that adds a fan slider/menu to Quick Settings,
 controlling thinkpad_acpi via a polkit-protected helper.
